        <mxCell id="native_43" value="返回码速查（native 侧）&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;0 成功　　-10 Host.dll 路径解析失败　　-12 ExecuteInDefaultAppDomain 失败　　-13 CTK_HOST_METHOD 非法&lt;br/&gt;-14 user_initialize 失败后重入　　托管异常 / 幂等拒绝 通常回 -1&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;DllMain 只做 Kernel32：禁止堆、线程、LoadLibrary、递归 mkdir。历史上若未链接 ucore，Creo 可能跑完 DllMain 却永不调 user_initialize。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F8FC;strokeColor=#B9C2D6;fontColor=#3A4560;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1560" width="1420" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="native_44" value="常量（host_entry.cpp）&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;kManagedAssembly = CreoToolkit.Host.dll&lt;br/&gt;kTypeName        = CreoToolkit.Host.Bootstrap&lt;br/&gt;kDefaultMethod   = InitializeApp&lt;br/&gt;kTerminateMethod = Terminate&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;允许的 CTK_HOST_METHOD：Initialize | InitializeAndAttach | InitializeApp。未设置 → InitializeApp。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F8FC;strokeColor=#B9C2D6;fontColor=#3A4560;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1720" width="1420" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
